                    {
                        "translation_id": "53e1cefe-a214-445b-97b2-c7af69b7ce3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "158d8683-ce28-3369-9247-8ad7058f6f7d",
                        "target_lang_word": "irruption",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irruption",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f56af18-9613-3229-b32d-afc8d62c81e4",
                                        "entry_id": "5616dc13-0c8f-309b-9a45-6b8993a4d93f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The action of irrupting or breaking into; a violent entry or invasion; an inbreaking; an intrusion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "549b87ba-101a-4e8f-b515-c95c2e8b8d17",
                                                "sense_id": "1f56af18-9613-3229-b32d-afc8d62c81e4",
                                                "text": "The Trojan irruption into the Greek camp is related in Book XV of the Iliad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18154edd-c097-437b-b0f9-c82616b53f16",
                                                "sense_id": "1f56af18-9613-3229-b32d-afc8d62c81e4",
                                                "text": "[I]t was not till arts and ſciences began to revive after the irruption of the Barbarians into Europe, that any thing of this kind appeared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5a8e5eb-4e3f-47b3-a0a2-06f00410fd20",
                                                "sense_id": "1f56af18-9613-3229-b32d-afc8d62c81e4",
                                                "text": "At that time it was thought that the critical section, in which an irruption of water from the river was to be feared, lay under the Shoots, but this proved not to be the case. Indeed, relatively little trouble was experienced from the Severn. The very serious flooding, which twice submerged part of the works, came from an underground river, (now known as the Great Spring), the presence of which was unsuspected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a89aaa7-0bc9-304e-9a71-67f1f8177226",
                                        "entry_id": "5616dc13-0c8f-309b-9a45-6b8993a4d93f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abrupt increase of an animal population."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac96a456-5e14-450a-87e2-f4550d2439a5",
                                                "sense_id": "4a89aaa7-0bc9-304e-9a71-67f1f8177226",
                                                "text": "Extreme rainfall events predict irruptions of rat plagues in central Australia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b5edafa-72a2-37b9-8478-76e0b675f95c",
                                        "entry_id": "5616dc13-0c8f-309b-9a45-6b8993a4d93f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abrupt increase in the size of a movement or organization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4fe759b-97f5-4ccb-ade5-0138cb968cda",
                                                "sense_id": "7b5edafa-72a2-37b9-8478-76e0b675f95c",
                                                "text": "How can we explain this irruption of young people self-identifying as socialists?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d41669b-2857-4507-83fe-470263dd0ccd",
                        "source_entry_id": "158d8683-ce28-3369-9247-8ad7058f6f7d",
                        "target_lang_word": "break into",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "break into",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b641e5ad-a29c-38cd-a1a7-07994bf7d08c",
                                        "entry_id": "859dbf02-67c9-3b5f-b315-9bcec23ff5a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To enter illegally or by force, especially in order to commit a crime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91bf213b-cc96-4d88-a822-13f37d9df934",
                                                "sense_id": "b641e5ad-a29c-38cd-a1a7-07994bf7d08c",
                                                "text": "Somebody broke into his car and stole his tools and CDs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1533d09-e098-47cd-9be8-c3461e4687b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b641e5ad-a29c-38cd-a1a7-07994bf7d08c",
                                                "text": "Hackers broke into the bank's computer system and stole customer data."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ff48fda-b3d3-315e-bca8-03f4bc39f367",
                                        "entry_id": "859dbf02-67c9-3b5f-b315-9bcec23ff5a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To open or begin to use."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8773e08a-e601-499b-8f07-8b43ec35f5ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3ff48fda-b3d3-315e-bca8-03f4bc39f367",
                                                "text": "I finally broke into the second package of cookies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f14295dc-4644-3af1-bdd4-2ca7a905b4c1",
                                        "entry_id": "859dbf02-67c9-3b5f-b315-9bcec23ff5a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To successfully enter a profession or business."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a959d76-c91d-46b8-b931-9c4a4ce35065",
                                                "sense_id": "f14295dc-4644-3af1-bdd4-2ca7a905b4c1",
                                                "text": "He hopes to break into show business."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                        "entry_id": "859dbf02-67c9-3b5f-b315-9bcec23ff5a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To begin suddenly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27cc46f2-08e4-40e0-b8a1-585f356fff26",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "The horse broke into a gallop as they neared the barn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7558d726-08e7-40dd-9f12-3d45c6098b6e",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "I just broke into tears while talking to my mom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b6db0c4-cdc0-4513-a119-0cd8694b6bd1",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "She broke into a smile, wrenching herself away from our head physician."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8887ebfb-3a2e-4fef-b9d1-84a190e172ed",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "Now, sometimes in my sorrow shut,\n⁠Or breaking into song by fits;\n⁠Alone, alone, to where he sits,\nThe Shadow cloak’d from head to foot\nWho keeps the keys of all the creeds,\n⁠I wander, often falling lame, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74377ef6-3a4e-4358-95e4-41f6796dbb50",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "Then, as usual, the sheep broke into \"Four legs good, two legs bad!\" and the momentary awkwardness was smoothed over."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37cc01f7-8aed-4d49-8e7b-bdfeb5c056ec",
                                                "sense_id": "faee5df1-0a2e-3aed-b798-4e279b1e9259",
                                                "text": "That struck me as hilarious, and I broke into hysterical giggles. And once I began, I couldn’t stop. I laughed until I was gasping for breath, tears streaming down my face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
